{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15561","headline":"乐游园望月 · 杨凭","name":"乐游园望月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎灵全盛地，明月半秋时。\n今古人同望，盈亏节暗移。\n彩凝双月逈，轮度八川迟。\n共惜鸣珂去，金波送酒巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}